/Alt (Four-panel figure shows speed response versus beta parameter in a control system. Panel \(a\) plots angular velocity over time for five beta values and a reference, showing overlap but slight deviation at higher betas. Panel \(b\) zooms in on velocity detail, highlighting oscillations for beta equals 0.1 and divergence for higher betas. Panel \(c\) displays tracking error over time, showing lower errors for smaller betas. Panel \(d\) is a bar chart plotting RMSE versus beta, showing error increases significantly with higher beta values.)
